## Implementation Details

The integration follows the exact pattern from the official Vercel Analytics quickstart guide for Next.js App Router projects:

```typescript
export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body className={`${dmSans.variable} ${instrumentSerif.variable}`}>
        <a className="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
        {children}
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

## Next Steps for Deployment

To activate Vercel Web Analytics in production:
1. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Analytics section)
2. Deploy the application using `vercel deploy`
3. Verify tracking is active by checking the browser Network tab for `/<unique-path>/view` requests

